return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T23:46:22+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T23:46:22+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Kaydinta boggaga iyo kaydka walxaha ee Redis ee degel kasta oo WordPress ah. Waxay adeegsataa kaydka server-ka LiteSpeed meeshii laga heli karo iyo kaydkeeda disk-ga meel kasta oo kale, waxay nadiifisaa oo keliya waxa isbeddelku saameeyo, waxayna xaqiijisaa in xidhiidhkeeda Redis uu shaqaynayo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Kaydka ku meel gaarka ah','Page cache'=>'Khasnada bogga','Object cache'=>'Kaydka ku meel gaarka ah ee walxaha','Purging'=>'Waa la nadiifinayaa','Exclusions'=>'Ka-reebitaanka','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakiilada AI (MCP)','Purge everything now'=>'Nadiifi wax walba hadda','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Bog kasta oo kaydsan waa la tuurayaa waxaana dib loo dhisi doonaa marka ay soo-booqdayaashu yimaadaan. Ma rabtaa inaad sii wadato?','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Oggolow wakiilada AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Dansan: qalabka hoose iyo waddooyinkooda REST gabi ahaanba ma diiwaangashana.','Full-page cache'=>'Kaydka bogga buuxa','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'Serfarka LiteSpeed dushiisa, boggaga waxaa bixiya serfarka shabakadda ka hor inta uusan WordPress shaqeynin. Serfar kasta oo kale, kordhintani waxay bog kasta u keydisaa fayl ahaan waxayna bixisaa ka hor inta uusan WordPress soo kicin. Halkaan ayaa laga helaa ku dhawaad dhammaan xawaaraha.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Ku kaydi bogagga kaydka xusuusta kuwa aan soo galin','How long a page stays cached'=>'Muddada boggu ku sii jirayo kaydka','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo. Hal toddobaad ayaa ku habboon boggagga badankood; bogga wararka ee daabaca saacad kasta wuxuu u baahan yahay wax aad uga yar.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Mudada uu biraawsarka booqdaha hayo sawirrada iyo qoraallada kombuyuutarka','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo. Waxay khusaysaa sawirrada, CSS iyo JavaScript oo keliya — marnaba ma khusayso bogagga. U dhig 0 si aad tan ugu dayso martigeliyahaaga.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Soo-boqdayaasha soo galay','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Waligaa bog la kaydiyay ha u adeegin booqde soo galay','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'Daaran waa doorashada badbaadada leh waana tan caadiga ah. Demi kaliya haddii aad ogtahay in bog kasta oo la kaydiyay uu isku mid u yahay isticmaale kasta oo soo galay — mareegaha xubnaha ayaa inta badan ah sababta aan sidaas loo samayn.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Waayo-nololeed kala duwan oo loogu talagalay nuxurro kala duwan','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Tusaale ahaan: bogagga alaabta dukaanka muddo hal saac ah, halka wax kasta oo kale ay sii jiraan toddobaad.','Add a rule'=>'Ku dar sharci','Content type'=>'Nooca nuxurka','Seconds'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Khashka walaxda (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Martigeliyahaagu wuxuu goobtan u maamulaa kaydka walxaha Redis ee gaarka ah wuuna ku hayaa qaabaysan. Halkan waxba lagama samaynayo; heerka sare ee shaashadan wuxuu muujinayaa inuu shaqaynayo iyo in kale.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Waxay keydisaa natiijooyinka weydiimaha keydka xogta. Waxay aad u caawisaa dukaamada mashquulka ah ama goobta leh taraafikada badan ee dadka soo galay, halkaas oo keydka boggu uusan waxba ka qaban karin.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Ku rakib drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha Redis','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Waxay u baahan tahay kordhinta phpredis. Haddii ay maqan tahay, sanduuqa ka sarreeya shaashaddan ayaa sheegaya.','Redis host'=>'Martigeliyaha Redis','Redis port'=>'Dekedda Redis','Redis database'=>'Kaydka xogta Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Sii degel kasta oo ku jira Redis la wadaago lambarkiisa u gaarka ah, haddii kale waxay tirtiri doonaan keydka ku meel gaarka ah (cache) ee midba midka kale.','Redis username'=>'Magaca isticmaalaha Redis','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Kaliya adeegaha Redis ee leh isticmaalayaasha ACL (Redis 6 ama ka dambeeya). Bannaan uga tag si aad ugu gasho erayga sirta ah oo keliya.','Redis password'=>'Furaha sirta ah ee Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Faaruq ka tag haddii Redis kaagu uusan u baahnayn.','Key prefix'=>'Horgalaha furaha','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Beddelka lambar xog-ururin gaar ah marka aadan mid yeelan karin.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Nadiifin toos ah oo caqli badan','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Si toos ah u bannee boggaga ay saameysay markii nuxurku isbeddelo','After updates'=>'Cusbooneysiinta kaddib','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Nadiifi wax walba ka dib marka la cusboonaysiiyo udub-dhexaadka, fur-halka ama dulucda','After a comment'=>'Faallada ka dib','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Nadiifi bogga qoraalka marka faallada ku saabsan la ansixiyo','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Tan dami qaybta faallada ee aadka mashquulka u ah, halkaas oo ay isla boggaas nadiifin karto boqolaal jeer saacaddiiba.','Never cache these'=>'Waligaa ha kaydin kuwan','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Habsocodyada caadiga ah ee habboon ee WordPress iyo WooCommerce mar walba waa la adeegsadaa — cart, checkout, my-account iyo kalfadhi kasta oo la soo galay waligood lama keydiyo (cached), wax kastaba ha ahaadeen kuwa hoose.','Addresses'=>'Cinwaannada','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Hal waddo xariiq kasta, tusaale ahaan <code>/basket</code>. Astaanta <code>*</code> ee dhammaadka waxay u dhigantaa wax kasta oo ka hooseeya.','Query parameters'=>'Xuduudaha weydiinta','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Bogga sita mid ka mid ah kuwan waligii lama kaydiyo — tusaale ahaan calaamadda horu-eegista hal mar ah.','Cookies'=>'Kukiyada','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Soo-booqe wata mid ka mid ah kuwan waxaa mar walba la siiyaa bog cusub.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Bogsi kasta oo la kaydiyay waa la tuuray. Dib baa loo dhisi doonaa marka ay soo-booqdayaashu yimaadaan.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'Khasnada walaxda waa la rakibay, laakiin waxba ma kaydinayso.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Khasnada bogga waa furan tahay, laakiin boggagga weli lama kaydinayo.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress weli ma soo rarin drop-in-ka kaydka bogga. Waxay bilaaban doontaa marka xigta ee bogga la soo raro; haddii ay bilaabmi weydo, hubi in WP_CACHE ay tahay true gudaha wp-config.php.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Khasnadda shayga (object cache) way daaran tahay, laakiin serfarkani ma laha taageerada Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Kordhinta phpredis ma rakibna, markaa drop-in lama isticmaali karo oo WordPress waxay dib ugu noqonaysaa kaydkeeda xusuusta gudaheeda ah. Weydiiso martigeliyahaaga inuu awood siiyo phpredis.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Waxba lama kaydinayo.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Labada kayd (cache) waa la damiyay, markaa furankan (plugin) ma ka dhigayo goobta mid dhakhso badan.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Kaydinta xogta kumeelgaarka ah (caching) way ka shaqaynaysaa boggan.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis wuxuu diiday magaca isticmaalaha ama furaha sirta ah. Ka hubi aqoonsiga Redis gudaha wp-config.php ama shaashadan.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis wuxuu aqbalay gelitaanka laakiin uma oggolaanayo goobtan inay kaydiso furayaasheeda. Isticmaalaha Redis wuxuu u baahan yahay oggolaansho horgalaha furaha goobtan.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis wuu diiday lambarka xog-ururinta. Hubi habaynta xog-ururinta Redis.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis xusuustii waa ka dhammaatay wuxuuna diidayaa xog cusub.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Kordhinta phpredis ma rakibna, sidaa darteed WordPress waxay isticmaalaysaa kaydkeeda xusuusta dhexdeeda ah. Weydiiso martigeliyahaaga inuu awood u yeelo phpredis.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'WP_REDIS_DISABLED waxa lagu dejiyay wp-config.php, markaa kaydka walxaha waa la damiyay.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Lama gaari karin server-ka Redis. Hubi host-ka iyo port-ka Redis, iyo in Redis uu shaqeynayo.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis ma soo celin qiimihii hadda lagu qoray. Hubi diiwaanka seerfarka Redis.','Web server'=>'Adeegaha shabakadda','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — boggaga waxa kaydiya adeegaha shabakadda','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'Ma aha LiteSpeed — boggaga waxa kayd diskiga ku haya furkan','Pages stored on disk'=>'Bogagga lagu kaydiyay diskiga','Redis support'=>'Taageerada Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis waa la rakibay','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis lama rakibin','Page lifetime'=>'Cimriga bogga','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Loma oggola inaad tirto khasnadda (cache).','Cache purge requested.'=>'Balanqaadka nadiifinta kaydka ayaa la codsaday.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: drop-in kale oo object-cache ah ayaa rakiban, sidaas darteed kaydka walxaha Redis laguma maamulo furinkan.','detected'=>'La ogaaday','not detected'=>'Lama helin','phpredis extension missing'=>'Kordhinta phpredis waa maqan tahay','installed, not storing anything'=>'rakiban, waxba ma kaydinayo','active, managed by your host'=>'firfircoon, waxaa maamula martigeliyahaaga','active'=>'Shaqaynaya','inactive'=>'Aan shaqeyneyn','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Kaydka LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Kaydka walxaha Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Kordhinta Redis PHP (phpredis) lagama heli karo server-kan, markaa ma suurtogal ahayn in la kiciyo kaydinta walxaha.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Drop-in kale oo object-cache ah ayaa mar hore la rakibay. Ka saar ka hor inta aadan shidin kaydka walxaha ee Zinn®.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Lama qori karin faylka habeynta isku xirka Redis.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Lama akhrin karin object-cache drop-in-ka la socday.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Lama rakibi karo object-cache drop-in galka wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Lama saari karin drop-in-ka object-cache.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Nidaamka faylka ee WordPress lama qori karo, sidaas darteed drop-in-ka object-cache lama maareyn karin.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Furitaan kale oo ah kaydka bogga ayaa rakibay wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Fadlan marka hore ka saar furitaankaas, ama sii wad isticmaalka kaydka boggiisa.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'Galka wp-content/cache/zinn-cache lama qori karin, sidaas darteed bogagga lama kaydin karo.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'wp-content/advanced-cache.php lama qori karin, markaa bogagga lama kaydin karo.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-deynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta Zinn® ma soo saarin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in goobtani gaari karto madasha Zinn®, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® (%s). Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado yar ka dib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay kuma guulaysan hubinta sax ahaanshaheeda lamana rakibin.','Go Pro'=>'U gudub Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Shaashadda falanqaynta kaydka xusuusta: saamiga garaacista, xusuusta, furayaasha iyo amarrada kaydka xusuusta ee ugu gaabiska badan.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Qalab lagu helo weydiimaha gaabiska ah iyo wicitaannada aan kaydsanayn oo sheegaya fur-bixiyaha ama mawduuca mas\'uulka ka ah.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Heerka APCu ee xusuusta dhexdeeda ah oo hortaagan Redis oo loogu talagalay furayaasha loogu isticmaalka badan yahay, oo ay weheliso horay-u-soo-qaadasho, isku-riixid iyo taxaneeyaha igbinary.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Nadiifinta ku saleysan sumadaha ee qoraallada, erayada iyo alaabada WooCommerce, si kaliya waxa isbeddelay loo tirtiro, iyadoo keydka bogga iyo kan shaygaba mar wada nadiifsamayaan.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Kuleylinta kaydka xogta ee tooska ah ka dib nadiifinta, sawirrada WebP iyo AVIF, ka saarista CSS-ka aan la isticmaalin iyo dib-u-dhigista JavaScript.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Nadiifinta xog-ururinta ee loo qorsheeyay oo leh horudhac, iyo xeerarka kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah ee bog kasta.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Digniinaha xaaladda kaydka ku meel gaarka ah ee dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital® marka heerka helitaanku hoos u dhaco ama xusuustu buuxsanto.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Wax kasta oo ku jira boggaga kale waa lacag la\'aan waxayna ahaanayaan lacag la\'aan. Pro waxa lagu rakibaa dusha sare ee furankan wuxuuna ku darayaa:','See what Pro costs'=>'Eeg qiimaha Pro','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Qorshe kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa 14 maalmood oo tijaabo bilaash ah, kaar looma baahna: %1$s sannadkii hal goob, %2$s shan goobood, %3$s goobo aan xadidnayn.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php lama helin, sidaas darteed WP_CACHE lama shidi karin. Ku dar define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); dhexdeeda.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php wuxuu mar hore WP_CACHE u qeexay false, sidaas darteed kaydka bogga ma bilaaban karo. U beddel true.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php lama qori karo, sidaas darteed WP_CACHE lama shidi karin. Ku dar define( \'WP_CACHE\', true );.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Waa la keydiyay. Ku qor qiimo cusub si aad ugu beddesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Kala shaandhee liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Kala shaandhee liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Waxba lama mid aha shaandhadaas.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar','Overview'=>'Dulmar guud','Copied'=>'Waa la koobiyey','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Xariir kasta oo Zinn® ah oo ku yaal boggan, iyo haddii uu shaqeynayo.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Xiriir looma baahna furigan.','Open settings'=>'Fur habaynta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ma haysatid oggolaansho aad ku beddesho goobahan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha habaynta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Keydi isbeddellada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofso habaynta','Reset to defaults'=>'Dib ugu celi sidii hore','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay dib u celinaysaa hab kasta oo ku saabsan fur-furehan kuwoodii asalka ahaa. Ma sii wadataa?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Baaritaanka taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo geli faylka habaynta','Import'=>'Soo deji','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyo marnaba kuma jiraan furaha sirta ah, calaamadaha (tokens) ama furayaasha API — waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad dib ugu geliso goobta cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Habsocodyada waa la keydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Dejinta kasta oo ku saabsan fur-bixintan waxay ku noqotay sidii hore.','Done.'=>'Waa dhammaatay.','That action is not available.'=>'Falkaas lama heli karo.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faylkaas lama akhrin karin. Dooro faylka habaynta ee laga soo dhoofiyay furaha Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi aad buu u weyn yahay inuu noqdo dhoofinta habaynta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi ma aha dhoofinta habaynta Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faylkaas waxaa laga dhoofiyay furin kale (%s), marka halkaan lagu soo dejiyo waxay keydineysaa habeyn aysan furintaan fahmeynin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d habayn ayaa la soo dejiyay. Furaha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan dhoofinta, markaa mar kale geli kuwaas.' . "\0" . '%d habeyn ayaa lasoo dejiyay. Erayada sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan xogta lasoo dhoofiyay, markaa dib u geli kuwaas.','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Connecting…'=>'Waa la xiriirinayaa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin wax baa u baahan dareen','Not connected'=>'Kuma xirna','Running on your own account'=>'Ku shaqeynaya koontadaada gaarka ah','We could not check this'=>'Ma aanan hubin karin tan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Furintaan ma aysan sheegin sababta. Soo dir warbixinta baaritaanka annagaana eegi doona.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xiriirka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Baadhitaankii ugu dambeeyay %s ka hor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'U dir tan taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Tani waa dhab ahaan waxa la diri doono — wax kale ma jiraan, waxna ma qarsoona. Furayaashaada sirta ah, tokens-ka iyo furayaasha API kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta ogaanshaha cilladaha ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nuqul u qaad sabuuradda','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'U dir warbixintan taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu furaynaa tikidh taageero waxaanan kaga jawaabaynaa iimayl. Haddii aad doorbidid inaadan dirin, kor ka koobiyeey oo adigu tikidh ku dheji.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Kama aan gaari karin Zinn Digital® serfarkan (%s). Nuqul ka qaad warbixinta sare oo taa beddelkeeda fur tigidh — wax khalad ah kuma jiraan habayntaada.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Qaybta caawinta ee Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxayna kaga soo jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada — tixraac %s — waxayna kaga jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad muddo gaaban gudaheed ku dirtay warbixinno dhowr ah. Sug dhowr daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day — kuwii hore way gaareen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma aqbali karin warbixinta hadda — taasi waa xaggeena, ma aha xaggaaga. Isku day mar dhow mar kale, ama koobi garee warbixinta sare oo ku dar tigidhka.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Kor ka koobiyi oo fur tikidh, adoo tixraacaya lambarkaas.','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Macaamiil martigelinta ah? Ka hel %1$d%% dhimis %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Macaamiil ahaan adeegga martigelinta ee Zinn Digital®, waxaad helaysaa koodh gaar ah oo loogu talagalay %d%% dhimis ah lacag-bixintaada koowaad. Cusboonaysiintu waxay ku socotaa qiimaha caadiga ah.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Hel koodhkayga %d%% oo u gudub bixinta','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, laguu ma oggola inaad taas samayso.','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Qiimo dhimistan waxaa loogu talagalay macaamiisha haysta qorshe martigelin oo lacag lagu bixiyay oo xaaladdiisu wanaagsan tahay. Tijaabooyinka bilaashka ahi uma qalmaan.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Hore ayaad u isticmaashay qiimo dhimista macaamiisha martigelinta ee furahan.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hadda ma aannu heli karin koodhkaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaal iyo adeegyo','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri buug-tilmaameedka isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari kan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, wareejinta bilaashka ah iyo qaybta maamulka oo loo dhisay dadka maamula in ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi goobo dhisan, xayndaabyo iyo meelaynta xiriiriyaha, iyada oo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinacba ay ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaalayso dad shaqadani noloshooda tahay','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa shaqada madaxa-bannaan ee caalamiga ah: baar in ka badan 10,000 adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab soo gudbiyaan.','Style preset'=>'Hab-dhismeedka hore loo diyaariyey','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Barta bilowga. Wax kasta oo ka hooseeya ayaa beddelaya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabbadayda iyo cabbirradayda gaarka ah','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Tan dami oo u daa, waxaana goob-horeedka loo isticmaali doonaa sida uu yahay sax ahaan.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'fure shati','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Isticmaale wali lama xiriirin shatiga, taas oo lagama maarmaan u ah ka hortagga hawlgelinta aan la oggolayn. Si aad shatiga ugu meelayso isticmaalahaaga, waxaad oggolaatay inaad wadaagto magaca oo buuxa iyo ciwaanka iimaylka ee isticmaalahaaga WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'bogagga kor ku xusan','Account'=>'Koonto','Account Details'=>'Faahfaahinta Koontada','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Koontadu waxay sugaysaa kicinta. Fadlan hubi iimaylkaaga oo guji xidhiidhka si aad u kiciso koontadaada ka dibna mar labaad soo gudbi foomka bahwadaagta.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ma doonaysaa inaad ku darto %1$s %2$s?','Actions'=>'Ficilada','Activate'=>'Hawlgeli','Activate Free Version'=>'Hawlgeli Nooca Bilaashka ah','Activate License'=>'Hawlgeli Shatiga','activate a license here'=>'Halkan kaga shaqaysii shatiga','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Fadlan geli furaha shatiga ee aad ku heshay iimaylka isla marka aad iibsatay ka dib:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Ka hawlgeli shatiga dhammaan goobaha ku jira shabakadda.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Ka hawlgeli shatiga dhammaan goobaha sugaya.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' Nooca lacag-bixinta ah ee %1$s mar hore ayaa la rakibay. Fadlan shid si aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga astaamaha %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' Nooca lacag bixinta ah ee %1$s mar hore ayaa la rakibay. Fadlan u gudub %2$s si aad u hawlgeliso oo aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga astaamaha %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Hawlgeli wax-ku-darkan','Activate %s'=>'Hawlgeli %s','Activate %s features'=>'Daar astaamaha %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Dhameystir Furitaanka "%s" Hadda','Activate %s Plan'=>'Hawlgeli Qorshaha %s','Activated'=>'La hawlgeliyay','Activating'=>'Hawlgelinaya','Activating license'=>'Hawlgelinta shatiga','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Koontadaada si guul leh ayaa loogu hawlgeliyay qorshaha %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Shaqeynaya','Add another domain'=>'Ku dar domain kale','Add-Ons'=>'Kordhinta','Add Ons for %s'=>'Kordhinta loogu talagalay %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Waan ku guulaysan weynay inaan soo rarno liiska waxyaabaha lagu kordhiyo. Waxay u badan tahay inay tahay cilad dhankayaga ah, fadlan isku day inaad dib ugu soo noqoto dhowr daqiiqo gudahood.','Add-On'=>'Kordhin','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s waa kordhin loogu talagalay keliya kuwa lacagta bixiya. Waa inaad marka hore iibsataa ruqsad ka hor inta aadan shaqaysiin furaha.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'Kordhinta %s si guul leh ayaa loo iibsaday.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Qorshahaaga dheeriga ah ee %s si guul leh ayaa loo cusboonaysiiyay.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Tijaabada bilaashka ah ee %s si guul leh ayaa loo joojiyay. Maadaama add-on-ku uu yahay mid qiimo leh (premium) oo keliya, si toos ah ayaa loo demiyay. Haddii aad doonayso inaad mustaqbalka isticmaasho, waa inaad iibsataa ruqsad.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ma shaqayn karo la\'aanta fur-halka.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ma shaqayn karo la\'aanteed %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kaliya waxaan ku ogeysiinaynaa in xogta ku-darka ah ee %s laga soo qaadanayo adeeg bixiye dibadda ah.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Ku-darka qaybta %s','Address'=>'Cinwaanka','Address Line %d'=>'Sadarka Ciwaanka %d','Affiliate'=>'Xiriir','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sababo la xiriira jebinta shuruudaha xiriirka wada-shaqeynta, waxaan go\'aansanay inaan si ku-meel-gaar ah u xannibno koontadaada wada-shaqeynta. Haddii aad wax su\'aalo ah qabtid, fadlan la xiriir caawinta.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Koontadaada xiriirka ayaa si ku meel gaar ah loo hakiyay.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Codsigaaga ku-xirnaanta ee %1$s waa la aqbalay! Gal aaggaaga ku-xirnaanta ee: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad codsatay barnaamijkeena xiriirka, nasiib darro, waxaan go\'aansanay xilligan inaan diidno codsigaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale 30 maalmood ka dib.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad codsatay barnaamijkeenna xiriirka, waxaan dib u eegi doonnaa faahfaahintaada 14-ka maalmood ee soo socda waxaanan dib kuugula soo xiriiri doonnaa macluumaad dheeraad ah.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s raadraaca kookiga booqashada kowaad kadib si loo kordhiyo fursada dakhliga.','Affiliation'=>'Xiriirka','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Marka uu shatigaagu dhaco waxaad wali isticmaali kartaa nooca Bilaashka ah laakiin MA heli doontid astaamaha %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Marka uu shatigaagu dhaco ma awoodi doontid inaad isticmaasho %s, ilaa aad mar kale ku hawlgeliso shati caymis oo sax ah mooyee.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Weli waad ku raaxaysan kartaa dhammaan astaamaha %1$s laakiin ma heli doontid cusboonaysiinta amniga & astaamaha %2$s, mana heli doontid taageero.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay cusboonaysiinta.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Kadib %1$s-kaaga bilaashka ah, bixi wax kayar %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Oggolow & Dhaqaaji Shatiga','I Agree - Change User'=>'Waan Oggolahay - Beddel Isticmaalaha','All Requests'=>'Dhammaan Codsiyada','All Types'=>'Dhammaan Noocyada','allow'=>'Oggolow','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Waxaad horey u dooratay dabagalka isticmaalkeena, taasoo naga caawisa inaan sii wadno hagaajinta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Hore ayaad uga qaybgashay la socoshada isticmaalkeena, taas oo naga caawinaysa inaan sii horumarino.','Amount'=>'Qadarka','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Sannadle','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Sannad kasta','Anonymous feedback'=>'Faallo qarsoodi ah','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Ku dabaq dhammaan boggaga ku jira shabakadda.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Ku dabaq dhammaan boggaga la sugayo.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Codso si aad u noqoto bahwadaag','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Oggolow oo Bilow Tijaabada','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Fadlan noo sheeg sababta si aan wax uga horumarino.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Hoos geli cinwaanka iimaylka aad u isticmaashay cusboonaysiinta waxaanan dib kuugu soo diri doonaa furaha shatiga.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli ciwaanka iimaylka aad isticmaashay intii aad wax iibsanaysay waxaanan dib kuugu soo diri doonaa furaha shatiga.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Ku xidh koontada milkiilaha shatiga.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Qoraa','Invalid module ID.'=>'Aqoonsiga cutubka oo aan sax ahayn.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ma haysatid shati sax ah oo aad ku gasho nooca qiimaha leh.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Rakibaadda tooska ah waxay u shaqaysaa kaliya isticmaalayaasha ogolaaday.','Premium version already active.'=>'Nooca qiimaha sare leh mar horeba wuu shaqaynayaa.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Nooca kordhinta qiimaha leh mar hore ayaa la rakibay.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Furaha (plugin) waa "Serviceware" taasoo la micno ah inuusan lahayn nooc koodh oo qaali ah (premium).','Automatic Installation'=>'Ku-shubid toos ah','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Demin toos ah gudahooda:','Average Rating'=>'Qiimeynta Celceliska ah','Awesome'=>'Cajiib','based on %s'=>'ku salaysan %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Noqo shuraako','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Ma ka heshay %s? Noo noqo danjire oo lacag kasbo ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Waad salaaman tahay, ma ogtahay in %1$s uu leeyahay barnaamij affiliate ah? Haddii aad jeceshahay %2$s waxaad noqon kartaa danjirahayaga oo waxaad kasban kartaa lacag!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Ugu fiican','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta nooca Beta waxay noocaaga %s ee rakiban ku beddeli doontaa noocii Beta ee ugu dambeeyay - u isticmaal si taxadar leh, oo ha ku isticmaalin boggaga tooska ah ee wax-soo-saarka. Waa lagugu digay.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'Laga qaaday %s','Billing'=>'Biilasha','Billing & Invoices'=>'Biilasha & Qaansheegyada','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Waa la xannibay','Blocking'=>'Xannibaya','Blog ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Blog-ka','Body'=>'Jirka','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Haa - labada ciwaanba anigaa iska leh','Bundle'=>'Xidhmo','Bundle Plan'=>'Qorshaha Xidhmada','Business name'=>'Magaca ganacsiga','Buy license'=>'Iibso shatiga','Buy a license now'=>'Iibso shatiga hadda','Cancel'=>'Jooji','Cancel Installation'=>'Jooji Rakibaadda','Cancel Subscription'=>'Jooji Diiwangelinta','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Haddii aadan qorsheyneynin inaad %1$s-kan ku isticmaasho goobtan (ama goob kale) - ma jeclaan lahayd inaad sidoo kale joojiso %2$s?','Cancel Trial'=>'Jooji Tijaabada','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Joojinta tijaabada waxay isla markiiba xannibi doontaa gelitaanka dhammaan astaamaha qiimaha leh. Ma hubtaa?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Jooji %s & Sii wad','Cancelled'=>'Waa la baajiyay','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Joojinta rukummada','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Miyaad heli weyday furaha shatigaaga?','Change License'=>'Beddel Shatiga','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Iimayl xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Waa inaad ku xaqiijisaa cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota gudahooda. Haddii aadan heli karin iimaylka, fadlan hubi faylkaaga spam-ka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Iimayl xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Mulkiilaha iimaylka waa inuu ku xaqiijiyaa cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota gudahooda.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s waa mulkiilaha cusub ee koontada.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay xaqiijinta beddelka lahaanshaha. Iimayl ayaa hadda loo diray %s si loo helo ansixinta kama dambaysta ah.','Change Ownership'=>'Beddel Lahaanshaha','Change Plan'=>'Beddel Qorshaha','Change User'=>'Beddel Isticmaalaha','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Markaad beddesho isticmaalaha, waxaad oggolaatay inaad lahaanshaha akoonka ku wareejiso:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Diiwaanka Isbeddelka','Changing user, please wait'=>'Bedelida isticmaalaha, fadlan sug','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Haddii aadan helin iimaylka, isku day inaad hubiso galkaaga spam-ka ama raadi iimayllada ka yimid %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Bixi lacagta','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Dooro ilaa %s goobood si aad shatiga uga hawlgeliso.','City'=>'Magaalo','Clear API Cache'=>'Nadiifi Khashka API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Nadiifi Xogaha Ku Meel Gaarka ah ee Cusbooneysiinta','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Halkan guji','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Guji halkan si aad fur-galka ugu isticmaasho si qarsoodi ah','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Guji si aad u aragto dib-u-eegista bixisay qiimeynta %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s waa cinwaanka iimaylka macmiilkayga','Code'=>'Kood','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'%s komishan ah marka macamiilku iibsado shati cusub.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Maadaama aan u hayno 30 maalmood lacag-celinta suurtagalka ah, waxaan bixinnaa oo keliya komishannada ka weyn 30 maalmood.','Communication'=>'Xiriirka','Compatible up to'=>'La jaanqaadi kara ilaa','complete the opt-in'=>'Dhameystir ka-qaybgalka','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hambalyo','Never miss an important update'=>'Waligaa ha seegin warbixin muhiim ah','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay cusboonaysiinta %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Dooro inaad hesho ogeysiisyada iimaylka ee ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga & muuqaallada cusub, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada mararka qaarkood, iyo inaad nala wadaagto macluumaad aasaasi ah oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress. Tani waxay naga caawin doontaa inaan %s ka dhigno mid aad ula jaanqaada boggaaga oo si fiican u qabta waxaad uga baahan tahay.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Dooro inaad hesho ogeysiisyada iimaylka ee ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga & astaamaha, nuxurka waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada mararka qaarkood, iyo inaad wadaagto xoogaa xog aasaasi ah oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Haddii aad tan ka gudubto, wax dhib ah ma laha! %1$s wali si fiican ayuu u shaqayn doonaa.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Waxaan soo kordhinay doorashadan si aadan waligaa u seegin cusboonaysiin muhiim ah oo aad nooga caawiso inaan %s ka dhigno mid aad ugu habboon goobtaada oo si fiican u qabata waxaad u baahan tahay.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Waxaan ku faraxsanahay inaan soo bandhigno isku-dhafka heerka shabakadda ee Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Intii lagu guda jiray habka cusboonaysiinta waxaan shabakadda dhexdeeda ku aragnay %s goobood oo wali sugaya dareenkaaga.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Intii lagu jiray habka cusboonaysiinta waxaan ogaannay %d goobood oo wali sugaya hawlgelinta shatiga.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Haddii aad rabto inaad %s ku isticmaasho boggagaas, fadlan hoos geli furahaaga shatiga oo guji badhanka hawlgelinta.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Haddii kale, waad ka boodi kartaa hadda oo waxaad shatiga ka hawlgelin kartaa hadhow, bogga Koontada heerka-shabakadeed ee %s-kaaga.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ku xiran','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Markaad dhamaysato, dami %s oo mar labaad shid.','Contact'=>'Xiriir','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Fadlan nala socodsii haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaan kula soo xiriirno si aan kuugu soo gudbinno wararka ku saabsan amniga iyo astaamaha cusub, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada xilliyada qaarkood:','Contact Support'=>'La xiriir Taageerada','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay dhibka kugu dhacay, waxaana diyaar u nahay inaan ku caawino haddii aad fursad na siiso.','Contact Us'=>'Nala soo xiriir','Please contact us here'=>'Fadlan halkan nagala soo xiriir','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Fadlan nala soo xiriir fariintan soo socota:','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Contributors'=>'Ka-qaybqaatayaasha','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Lama hawlgelin karo %s.','Country'=>'Dalka','Cron Type'=>'Nooca Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Waxaan u adeegsannaa maktabadda PHP cURL wicitaannada API, taas oo ah maktabad aad u caan ah oo inta badan si toos ah loo rakibo lana howlgeliyo. Nasiib-darro, cURL kama shaqaysna (ama waa la damiyay) serfarkaaga.','data'=>'Xogta','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Habka sixitaanka khaladaadka si guul leh ayaa loo furay waxaana si toos ah loo damin doonaa 60 daqiiqo gudahood. Waxaad sidoo kale damin kartaa waqti hore adigoo gujinaya xiriiriyaha "Stop Debug".','Date'=>'Taariikh','Deactivate'=>'Demi','Deactivate the free version'=>'Dami nooca bilaashka ah','Deactivate License'=>'Dami Shatiga','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Damiinta shatigaaga waxay xannibi doontaa dhammaan astaamaha caymiska leh, laakiin waxay awood u siin doontaa in shatiga laga hawlgeliyo goob kale. Ma hubtaa inaad doonayso inaad sii waddo?','Deactivation'=>'Deactivation','Yes - %s'=>'Haa - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Geli oo %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Deminta ama ka saaridda %s waxay si toos ah u joojin doontaa shatiga, kaas oo aad awoodi doonto inaad ku isticmaasho goob kale.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Haddii aad daqiiqad haysato, fadlan noo sheeg sababta aad %s','Debug Log'=>'Diiwaanka Cilad-bixinta','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Khalad-saxid','delegate'=>'Wakiilo','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Haddii aad gujiso, go\'aankan waxa loo wakiilan doonaa maamulayaasha boggaga.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'U wakiilo Maamulayaasha Bogga','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'U wakiilo Maamulayaasha Bogga oo Sii wad','Delegating, please wait'=>'Wakiilasho ayaa socota, fadlan sug','verbDelete'=>'Tirtir','Delete All Accounts'=>'Tirtir Dhammaan Koontooyinka','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad tirtirto dhammaan xogta Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Faahfaahin','Details'=>'Faahfaahinta','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our records.'=>'Waxay u muuqataa in furihii aad gelisay uusan u dhigmin diiwaankayaga.','Diagnostic Info'=>'Xogta Baaritaanka','Disabling white-label mode'=>'Deminta habka sumad-la\'aanta','Disconnect'=>'Kala xiriir','Are you sure you would like to proceed with the disconnection?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad sii waddo goynta xidhiidhka?','If you wish to cancel your %1$s plan\'s subscription instead, please navigate to the %2$s and cancel it there.'=>'Haddii aad beddelkeeda doonayso inaad baajiso rukumashada qorshahaaga %1$s, fadlan u gudub %2$s oo halkaas kaga baaji.','as close a windowDismiss'=>'Iska caafi','do %1$sNOT%2$s send me security & feature updates, educational content and offers.'=>'%1$sHA%2$s ii soo dirin cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, nuxurka waxbarashada iyo dalabyada.','Enter the domain of your website or other websites from where you plan to promote the %s.'=>'Geli magaca domain-ka boggaaga internetka ama bogag kale oo aad qorshaynayso inaad ka dhiirrigeliso %s.','Where are you going to promote the %s?'=>'Halkeed ku dhiirrigelinaysaa %s?','Domain is required.'=>'Domain-ka waa loo baahan yahay.','Donate to this plugin'=>'U ku deeq furahan','Done'=>'Waa dhammaaday','Don\'t cancel %s - I\'m still interested in getting security & feature updates, as well as be able to contact support.'=>'Ha joojin %s - Waxaan weli daneynayaa helitaanka cusbooneysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, iyo sidoo kale inaan la xiriiri karo taageerada.','Don\'t have a license key?'=>'Miyaanad haysan furaha shatiga?','You might have missed it, but you don\'t have to share any data and can just %s the opt-in.'=>'Waxa laga yaabaa inaad seegtay, laakiin maaha inaad wax xog ah wadaagto oo waxaad si fudud u %s kartaa ka-qaybgalka.','verbDowngrade'=>'Hoos u dhig','%1$s will immediately stop all future recurring payments and your %2$s plan license will expire in %3$s.'=>'%1$s wuxuu isla markiiba joojin doonaa dhammaan lacag-bixinnada soo noqnoqda ee mustaqbalka, laysanka qorshahaaga %2$s wuxuu dhici doonaa %3$s gudahood.','Downgrading'=>'Hoos u dhigaya','Downgrading your plan'=>'Hoos u dhigidda qorshahaaga','Download'=>'Soo deji','as download latest versionDownload Latest'=>'Soo dejiso kii u