keting the product from.'=>'Domain-yo dheeraad ah oo aad ka suuqgeyn doonto alaabta.','Extra Domains'=>'Bogag Dheeraad ah','Freemius SDK couldn\'t find the plugin\'s main file. Please contact sdk@freemius.com with the current error.'=>'Freemius SDK ma helin faylka guud ee plagin-ka. Fadlan la xiriir sdk@freemius.com adigoo wata qaladkan hadda jira.','Plugin installer section titleFAQ'=>'Su\'aalaha Badanaa La Isweydiiyo','Plugin installer section titleFeatures & Pricing'=>'Astaamaha & Qiimaha','We made a few tweaks to the %1$s, %2$s'=>'Waxaan wax yar ka beddelnay %1$s, %2$s','File'=>'Fayl','Filter'=>'Sifee','Please follow these steps to complete the upgrade'=>'Fadlan raac talaabooyinkan si aad u dhamaystirto cusboonaysiinta','Free'=>'Bilaash','Add-on must be deployed to WordPress.org or Freemius.'=>'Kordhinta waa in la geeyaa WordPress.org ama Freemius.','Free Trial'=>'Tijaabo Bilaash ah','Free version'=>'Nooca bilaashka ah','Freemius API'=>'Freemius API','Freemius Debug'=>'Khalad-saxidda Freemius','Freemius State'=>'Xaaladda Freemius','Full name'=>'Magaca oo buuxa','Function'=>'Shaqo','Get updates for bleeding edge Beta versions of %s.'=>'Hel cusbooneysiinta noocyadii ugu dambeeyay ee Beta ee %s.','Have a license key?'=>'Ma leedahay furaha shatiga?','advance notice of something that will need attention.Heads up'=>'Ogeysiis','exclamationHey'=>'Haye','greetingHey %s,'=>'Hay %s,','verbHide'=>'Qari','something somebody says when they are thinking about what you have just said.Hmm'=>'Hmm','How to upload and activate?'=>'Sidee loo geliyaa oo loo hawlgeliyaa?','ID'=>'Aqoonsi','You are already running the %s in a trial mode.'=>'Waxaad mar horeba ku waddaa %s hab tijaabo ah.','In %s'=>'Gudaha %s','Install Free Version Now'=>'Ku shub Nooca Bilaashka ah Hadda','Install Free Version Update Now'=>'Ku shub Cusboonaysiinta Nooca Bilaashka ah Hadda','Install Now'=>'Ku shub Hadda','Install Update Now'=>'Hadda Ku Shub Cusboonaysiinta','Plugin installer section titleInstallati