es and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'Khalad API oo aan la filayn ayaa dhacay intii lagu guda jiray ka shaqaynta codsigaaga. Fadlan isku day markale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib oo haddii ay weli shaqayn weydo, la xiriir qoraaga %s adiga oo la wadaagaya waxyaabaha soo socda:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Khalad aan la filayn, isku day mar kale 5 daqiiqo gudahood. Haddii khaladku sii jiro, fadlan la xiriir caawinta.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Ka saarista %s waxay si toos ah u joojin doontaa shatiga, kaas oo aad awoodi doonto inaad ku isticmaasho goob kale.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Khalad aan la garanayn ayaa dhacay.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Komiishanno aan xadidnayn.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Cusboonaysiino aan xadidnayn','verbUpdate'=>'Cusboonaysii','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Ma doonaysaa inaad sii waddo cusboonaysiinta?','Update'=>'Cusboonaysii','Update License'=>'Cusbooneysii Shatiga','Upgrade'=>'Hormari','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Ogeysiis Muhiim ah oo ku saabsan Casriyeynta:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Soo geli oo shaqaysii nooca la soo dejiyay','User Dashboard'=>'Meesha Isticmaalaha','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, ma dhammaystiri karin cusboonaysiinta iimaylka. Isticmaale kale oo wata isla iimaylkan ayaa horay loo diiwaangeliyay.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Haddii aad rabto inaad lahaanshaha akoonka %1$s ku wareejiso %2$s, guji batoonka Beddel Lahaanshaha.','User ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Isticmaalaha','User key'=>'Furaha isticmaalaha','Users'=>'Isticmaalayaasha','Value'=>'Qiimaha','Verification mail was just sent to %s. If you can\'t find it after 5 min, plea