s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'%2$s ma nuqul labaad baa ka ah %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Ku biir Barnaamijka Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Ku biir barnaamijka Beta','License'=>'Shatiga','License Key'=>'Furaha Shatiga','License key'=>'Furaha shatiga','Monthly'=>'Bille kasta','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Magacyada, slugs-ka, noocyada, iyo haddii ay shaqeynayaan iyo haddii kale','New Version Available'=>'Nooc Cusub Ayaa Diyaar Ah','Optional'=>'Ikhtiyaari','Plan'=>'Qorshe','Products'=>'Badeecadaha','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Wadaagista xogta baadhitaanku waxay gacan ka geysataa bixinta shaqooyin dheeraad ah oo khuseeya mareegtaada, ka fogaanshaha is-waafaqid la\'aanta noocyada WordPress ama PHP ee waxyeellayn kara mareegta, iyo garashada luuqadaha iyo gobollada ay tahay in %s loo turjumo loona habeeyo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Si aad dib ugu isticmaasho shatiga marka %s aanu shaqeyneynin.','Subscription'=>'Diiwaangelin','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s wuxuu xilliyo go\'an xogta muhiimka ah ee shatiga u diri doonaa %2$s si loo hubiyo cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha cusub, loona xaqiijiyo ansaxnimada shatigaaga.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Waxaa diyaar ah %1$s ka mid ah %2$s.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Si loo xaqiijiyo iswaafaqsanaanta loogana fogaado iska hor imaadyada la xiriira furayaasha (plugins) iyo mawduucyada (themes) aad rakibatay.','Trial'=>'Tijaabo','View %s State'=>'Fiiri Xaaladda %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Eeg Macluumaadka Aasaasiga ah ee %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Haa, %2$s waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s oo loogu talagalay tijaabinta, tijaabinta hordhaca ah (staging), ama horumarinta.','You have a %s license.'=>'Waxaad haysataa shatiga %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Waxaad iibsatay shatiga %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Waa inaad ku heshaa iimaylka xaqiijinta ee %1$s sanduuqaaga boostada ee %2$s. Fadlan hubi inaad riixdo badhanka ku jira iimaylkaas si aad %3$s.','days'=>'maalmood','deactivating'=>'Deminaya','hour'=>'saac','hours'=>'saacadood','license'=>'Shatiga','optional'=>'ikhtiyaari','products'=>'Badeecooyinka','skip'=>'Ka bood','subscription'=>'Rukummada','trial'=>'Tijaabo','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Alaabta','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Hawlgelinaya','as software licenseLicense'=>'Shatiga','close a windowDismiss'=>'Dhaaf','close windowDismiss'=>'Iska dhaaf','like websitesSites'=>'Bogagga webka','nounPricing'=>'Qiimaha','trial periodTrial'=>'Tijaabo','verbOpt In'=>'Ka qaybgal','verbOpt Out'=>'Ka bax','verbSkip'=>'Ka bood','verbUpgrade'=>'Kor u qaad','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s kahor','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Falka lama dhamaystiri karin. Isku day mar kale, haddii ay weli shaqayn weydana, la xiriir maamulaha goobta.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Qiime loo baahnaa ayaa maqan ama qaab qaldan ku jira. Hubi qaab-dhismeedka gelinta (input schema) ee awoodda.','The site refused the request.'=>'Boggu wuxuu diiday codsigii.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'U oggolow kaaliyeyaasha AI sida Claude, Cursor ama VS Code inay boggan kuugu shaqeeyaan iyagoo adeegsanaya MCP (Model Context Protocol). Waxay u galaan sidii isticmaale WordPress ah oo wata erayga sirta ah ee dalabka waxayna qaban karaan oo keliya waxa isticmaalahaas loo oggol yahay.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakiilada AI waxay u baahan yihiin WordPress 6.9 ama ka dambeeya. Cusboonaysii WordPress si aad u isticmaasho.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirka (barta dhammaadka MCP)','Create an application password for your user'=>'U samee furaha sirta ah ee codsiga isticmaalahaaga','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ku dar tan habaynta MCP ee abkaaga AI, adigoo isticmaalaya magacaaga isticmaalaha iyo eraygaas sirta ah:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: isla gelitaankaas geli qaybta hoose ee "servers" ee .vscode/mcp.json, ee ha gelin qaybta hoose ee "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Aaladaha uu wakiilka AI halkan ku isticmaali karo (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha: Wakiilada AI iyo MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dukumentiyada horumariyaha: awoodaha, REST iyo MCP','Check and purge this site\'s cache and change its cache settings with Zinn® Cache.'=>'Hubi oo nadiifi kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah ee goobtan oo ku beddel goobaha kaydka Zinn® Cache.','Page and object cache status, purging and settings.'=>'Xaaladda kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah ee bogga iyo walxaha, nadiifinta iyo goobaha.','Read the cache status'=>'Akhri xaaladda khasnada','Returns whether the page cache and the object cache are on and working, how many pages are cached, and the object cache\'s connection and hit numbers.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa haddii khasdiga bogga iyo khasdiga sheyga ay shaqaynayaan oo ay daaran yihiin, tirada boggagga la khasdiyey, iyo tirada isku-xirka iyo helitaanka khasdiga sheyga.','Read the cache settings'=>'Akhri habaynta kaydka','Returns every cache setting. The Redis password is never returned, only whether one is saved.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa hab kasta oo khasdka ah. Furaha sirta ah ee Redis marnaba lama soo celiyo, kaliya haddii mid la keydiyay.','Change the cache settings'=>'Beddel habaynta kaydka xogta','Changes the settings you send and keeps the rest (page cache, how long pages stay cached, the object cache and its Redis connection, purging rules and exclusions). Values are checked and corrected exactly as on the Cache screen.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa habaynta aad dirtay waxayna haysaa inta kale (kaydka barta, muddada ay boggagu kaydsan yihiin, kaydka walxaha iyo xidhiidhkiisa Redis, xeerarka nadiifinta iyo waxyaabaha laga reebay). Qiyamka waxa loo hubiyaa loona saxaa si la mid ah sida shaashadda Kaydka.','Put the cache settings back to their defaults'=>'Ku celi habaynta kaydka xogta ee ku meel gaarka ah xaaladdii hore','Puts every cache setting back to its default, as the Reset button does. The saved Redis password is removed too.'=>'Waxay ku celisaa hab kasta oo khasdhasho ah tii caadiga ahayd, sida uu badhanka Dib-u-dejiyeeyo sameeyo. Furaha sirta ah ee Redis ee la keydiyay sidoo kale waa laga saarayaa.','Read the diagnostics report'=>'Akhri warbixinta baaritaanka','Returns the diagnostics report support asks for: versions, server limits, the cache state and recent errors. It holds no passwords or keys.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa warbixinta baaritaanka ee taageeradu codsato: noocyada, xaddidyada server-ka, xaaladda cache-ka iyo khaladaadkii ugu dambeeyay. Kuma jiraan wax furaha sirta ah ama furayaal.','Purge the cache'=>'Nadiifi khasnada','Discards cached pages: everything (all: true), some addresses (urls) or everything tagged (tags). Pages are rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Waxay tuurtaa boggaga keydsan: wax kasta (all: true), cinwaannada qaar (urls) ama wax kasta oo la calaamadeeyay (tags). Boggaga dib ayaa loo dhisaa marka ay soo-booqdayaashu yimaadaan.']];